# ─── FlowPro Web — example configuration ────────────────────────────
# Copy to .env.development (or .env.local) and fill in.
# The web app has no runtime env vars; this file only controls the
# Vite dev server's API proxy target.

# Override the dev API proxy target when port 3001 is taken (e.g.
# another worktree's API running). Defaults to http://localhost:3001
# when unset. Example: http://localhost:4001
# VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:3001
